at|^j TABLE OF CONTENTS|fp||

ht|n|at|^*GA1,1.  Who has wimped out^*N|
                  
ht|o|at|^*GA2,2.  Handling entries and unblocking is an important part of declaring^*N|
                  
ht|p|at|^*GA3,3.  If you open with a weak hand in 4th seat you know nothing about bridge^*N|
                  
ht|q|at|^*GA4,4.  Kickback RKCB^*N|
                  
ht|r|at|^*GA5,5.  Perfect auction^*N|
                  
ht|s|at|^*GA6,6.  It pays to stretch with a 9-card fit bidding game.^*N|


