mb|P3h|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|3@H is preemptive. You need to bid 2@D to show a limit raise. Using a cue bid as a limit raise and preemptive jump raises are both extremely important competitive bidding methods. Let me give you an undo.|
