up|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I have been in worse slams. Let me review and count my |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=declarerpoints,Bergen Declarer Points^*N|CP||FP||at| to find out where did I go wrong once partner shows a limit raise.|

