PG| ***** 15 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|My hand is worth 23 |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=declarerpoints,Bergen Declarer Points^*N|CP||FP||at|. They are 17 HCP, 2 length points, 2 points for singleton, 1 points for side 4+ card club suit, and 1 point for 4 aces and tens and only one queen.|

n#|9|at|^^^fIf you do follow the link you can return  HERE  by clicking the  |fp|1|n#|3|at|@L|fp||n^|3|at|   icon button, top left.|
PG| ***** 16 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Perhaps I should have looked for slam. Slam makes whenever hearts are 2-2 or the @HK is onside which are pretty good odds though I was worried about about 2 heart losers.|
PG| ***** 17 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^^B@2^*BNorth: ^*NYou are correct. Maybe I underbid.|
PG| ***** 18 ***** |


cp|8|AT|^^
^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Not at all. With 13 |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=dummypoints,Dummy Points^*N|CP||FP||at| you made a limit raise or better.|

