nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|And Bergen hand evaluation says we should be there but I wimped out. I was the one who needed to drive to slam, but was worried about the weak hearts which were indeed a problem.|
PG| ***** 20 ***** |


