mb|3C|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|If not vulnerable, I might venture a 3@D bid with the North hand. However, at this vulnerabity, it is a bit risky and also suggests a sacrifice bid which is not clear.|
