mb|3H|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|East has 16 |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=declarerpoints,Bergen Declarer Points^*N|CP||FP||at|--14 HCP, -l one for dubious Jx in diamonds, +1 length point, +1 point for 2 doubletons, +1 point for side 4 card heart suit, +1 point for 4 aces/tens and only one queen/jack. That is enough to bid game rather than just invite.|
