mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|4S|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|West has 11 |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=dummypoints,Dummy Points^*N|CP||FP||at| (10 HCP + 1 for doubleton). I don't dislike 4@S and probably bid it in IMPs but in Match Points it is less clear. However in general you should stretch to bid games with 9-card fit.|
