up|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|It is not obvious how to play the hand. One possibility is to draw trump first to see how many trump losers you have. Another possibility would be to play 2 more rounds of clubs and discard a diamond.|
