up|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|So it was a good game. As to the comment about "preempting" as I said, 2@H is NOT a preempt. It shows 11-14 with 6 nice hearts which is exactly what East has.|
PG| ***** 56 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^^B@2^*BA Kib: ^*NIs the 2@H bid alertable?|
PG| ***** 57 ***** |


cp|8|AT|^^
^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|No, it is standard bridge, although it never hurts on BBO to alert. Admittedly many players are not familiar with it. However, you are definitely not required to do so and I would not alert it in live bridge.|
PG| ***** 58 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^^B@2^*BAnother Kib: ^*NIf you open with a genuinely weak hand in 4th seat you don't understand bridge.|
