mb|D|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|West has no clear bid. There is no standard meaning for double. I play it as a ^*BStolen Bid Double^*n meaning it says had I passed, West was going to bid 2@S. But West is too strong for a 2@S bid, which shows 6-9. However, West has no good bid. I would make a very imperfect cue bid of 3@H, showing a limit raise or better in spades. I don't like doing that with only 3 small spades, but there is no better choice. |
